{"id":"8aebe42487aca071","group":"28","path":"28/28-lem-flat-source-convex-decomposition.md","title":"弱随机源的平坦源凸分解","display":"lem-flat-source-convex-decomposition — 弱随机源的平坦源凸分解","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-lem-flat-source-convex-decomposition","aliases":["28-lem-flat-source-convex-decomposition"],"display":"lem-flat-source-convex-decomposition — 弱随机源的平坦源凸分解","depends_on":["[[28-df-min-entropy]]","[[28-df-flat-source]]"],"source_book_location":"Proof of Theorem 21.25; Exercise 19.7","source_printed_pages":"444,400","source_pdf_pages":"470,426","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"local_proof_reviewed":true,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"proved-in-note; source-statement-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-lem-flat-source-convex-decomposition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-lem-flat-source-convex-decomposition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-flat-source-convex-decomposition — 弱随机源的平坦源凸分解"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f79df9244d067310\" href=\"?note=f79df9244d067310\" title=\"28-df-min-entropy\">28-df-min-entropy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b191494d56cdc254\" href=\"?note=b191494d56cdc254\" title=\"28-df-flat-source\">28-df-flat-source</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Proof of Theorem 21.25; Exercise 19.7"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"444,400"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"470,426"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note; source-statement-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\(k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}\">\\(p\\in\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f79df9244d067310\" href=\"?note=f79df9244d067310\" title=\"28-df-min-entropy\">28-df-min-entropy</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Flat}_{n,k}\">\\(\\operatorname{Flat}_{n,k}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b191494d56cdc254\" href=\"?note=b191494d56cdc254\" title=\"28-df-flat-source\">28-df-flat-source</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists t\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\exists(p_1,\\ldots,p_t)\\in\\operatorname{Flat}_{n,k}^t\\;\\exists(\\alpha_1,\\ldots,\\alpha_t)\\in[0,1]^t\\quad\\left(\\sum_{i=1}^t\\alpha_i=1\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;p(x)=\\sum_{i=1}^t\\alpha_i p_i(x)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists t\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\exists(p_1,\\ldots,p_t)\\in\\operatorname{Flat}_{n,k}^t\\;\\exists(\\alpha_1,\\ldots,\\alpha_t)\\in[0,1]^t\\quad\\left(\\sum_{i=1}^t\\alpha_i=1\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;p(x)=\\sum_{i=1}^t\\alpha_i p_i(x)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地证明：有限多面体 P={p:Σp=1,0≤p_x≤2^(−k)} 的极点不可能有两个严格介于两端的坐标，否则可对两坐标作相反小扰动而分解。也不可能恰有一个中间坐标，因为乘以 2^k 后质量和是整数。因此极点恰有 2^k 个坐标等于 2^(−k)，其余为零。有限有界多面体为极点凸包，得到有限分解。这里使用实数质量，不假设概率有理。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Proof of Theorem 21.25; Exercise 19.7；印刷页 444,400；PDF 页 470,426。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-min-entropy","status":"resolved","id":"f79df9244d067310","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-min-entropy]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-flat-source","status":"resolved","id":"b191494d56cdc254","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-flat-source]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-min-entropy","status":"resolved","id":"f79df9244d067310","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}$，$p\\in\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}$ 见 [[28-df-min-entropy]]；$\\operatorname{Flat}_{n,k}$ 见 [[28-df-flat-source]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-flat-source","status":"resolved","id":"b191494d56cdc254","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}$，$p\\in\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}$ 见 [[28-df-min-entropy]]；$\\operatorname{Flat}_{n,k}$ 见 [[28-df-flat-source]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Flat}_{n,k}","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists t\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\exists(p_1,\\ldots,p_t)\\in\\operatorname{Flat}_{n,k}^t\\;\\exists(\\alpha_1,\\ldots,\\alpha_t)\\in[0,1]^t\\quad\\left(\\sum_{i=1}^t\\alpha_i=1\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;p(x)=\\sum_{i=1}^t\\alpha_i p_i(x)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1798,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-390","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-graph-power]]、[[28-df-graph-tensor-product]]、[[28-df-replacement-product]]、[[28-thm-tensor-product-expansion]]、[[28-thm-replacement-product-expansion]]、[[28-df-flat-source]]、[[28-lem-flat-source-convex-decomposition]]、[[28-df-branching-program]]、[[28-df-undirected-connectivity]]、[[28-thm-reingold]]、[[28-df-space-bounded-prg]]、[[28-thm-nisan-space-prg]]。"}],"outgoing":["f79df9244d067310","b191494d56cdc254"]}